--- !u!114 &-7462842858057216151
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b>The forecourt.</b> A ProBuilder cube 60 \xD7 0.1 \xD7 60 m, its top at y = 0, named <i>Ground</i> under an empty parent <i>Forecourt</i>. Its UVs are set to world space in metres (<i>UV Editor \u203A Auto \u203A World Space</i>), so a texture's tiling is the same on every face and size."
